# Colombia — tiquete de transporte estudiantil (c. 1969)

Read `docs/sources/colombia-transporte-estudiantil/README.md` before adding or describing this piece.

A forthcoming Notofilia item is an old **printed student-transport ticket / voucher** from Colombia, late 1960s — popularly called a “billete,” **technically a tiquete de subsidio or boleto de control**.

- **Decreto 188 de 1969** (government of President Carlos Lleras Restrepo; Minister of Education Octavio Arizmendi Posada) regulated the student-transport subsidy.
- Face value: **5 centavos**. Used as proof of payment so urban collective-transport vehicles admitted students at the reduced fare.
- Today: vintage / historical collectible of Colombian civil and school history.

**Do not catalogue it as a Banco de la República banknote.** Do not invent Pick or González White BG#. Closest site pattern is miscellaneous scrip, not a BanRep type. Confirm serial / `no_serial_reason` and run `30-catalogue-duplicates.mdc` before creating `src/data/` or routes. No holding exists yet for this brief.
